### ===== Product API 测试 =====
### 基础 URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5255

### ===== 测试 1：获取产品列表（无筛选）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 2：获取产品列表（分页）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 3：根据分类筛选 =====
# categoryId=1 (咖啡豆)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?categoryId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 4：根据子分类筛选 =====
# subcategoryId=1 (单品咖啡)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?categoryId=1&subcategoryId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 5：搜索产品 =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?searchTerm=Ethiopian
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 6：价格排序（低到高）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sortBy=PriceLowToHigh
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 7：价格排序（高到低）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?sortBy=PriceHighToLow
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 8：价格区间筛选 =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?minPrice=20&maxPrice=50
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 9：根据 ID 获取产品详情 =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 10：根据 Slug 获取产品详情 =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/slug/ethiopian-yirgacheffe
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 11：获取精选产品 =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/featured
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 12：获取精选产品（限制数量）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/featured?limit=3
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 13：组合筛选（分类 + 价格 + 排序）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?categoryId=1&minPrice=20&maxPrice=50&sortBy=PriceLowToHigh
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 14：标签筛选（新品）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?isNewArrival=true
Accept: application/json

###

### ===== 测试 15：标签筛选（有机）=====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?isOrganic=true
Accept: application/json

###
